WEBVTT

00:14:29.448 --> 00:14:30.741
AK: It feels good.

00:14:30.782 --> 00:14:35.329
And at the same time, as I said before,

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.039
it is a responsibility.

00:14:38.123 --> 00:14:40.959
I mean, my work,

00:14:40.959 --> 00:14:45.422
I've been nominated first time
at the Grammys, it was in 1993, '94.

00:14:46.924 --> 00:14:49.426
And the first Grammy I won was 2007.

00:14:51.011 --> 00:14:53.138
And I said to people,

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:55.140
don't take Grammy for granted.

00:14:55.182 --> 00:14:58.352
It's not about how many likes you have,

00:14:58.393 --> 00:14:59.937
it's what you have to say.